<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORE 339-4 V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORE 339-4 V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>MOHALI, India 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka scored 339 for four in their 50 overs against Pakistan in the first of the best-of-three finals of the four-nation Independence Cup cricket tournament on Saturday.</p>
</text>
